  "prefLabel": "Plc 1502.19 Personal contact information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.19 “Personal contact information” means an individual’s home or personal telephone number, designated email address, home physical address, and home mailing address if different.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13621, eff 5-22-23",
